<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Admiral renews earlier cautionary on buy.</title>
<headline>Admiral renews earlier cautionary on buy.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Admiral Leisure World Ltd on Friday renewed an earlier cautionary in which it said it was in talks to buy an international company which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>The company said on February 27 if the acquisition was successful, it would be funded partly by the issue of new shares and partly out of borrowings.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to continue to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
